# Out of shield: hit the shielding dummy; it answers out of shield. Punish its option, don't get punished.
name: Out of shield
about: Hit the dummy's shield. It jumps, nairs, grabs, up-Bs, spot-dodges or rolls; punish it within 35 frames.
start: here
cpu: shield
adapt: oos
options: jump nair grab upb spotdodge roll
weights: 4 4 4 4 4 4
trigger: dummy_oos
success: hit 35
par: 8
timeout: 480
loop: after 45
